WEBVTT

00:00:03.535 --> 00:00:06.015
VOICE BOX: I'm Gabby Gabby,
and I love you.

00:00:07.735 --> 00:00:09.375
(CHUCKLING) I'm gonna cry.

00:00:13.655 --> 00:00:14.855
Oh, what have you got there?

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.735
I found this old doll.

00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:19.855
MARGARET: You can take it home
if you want.

00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:22.735
Nah.

00:00:25.495 --> 00:00:26.495
(BOTH GASP)

00:00:30.535 --> 00:00:32.895
What happened? Gabby was
supposed to be her toy.

00:00:33.055 --> 00:00:34.695
-BONNIE: There's my backpack!
-(WOODY GASPS)

00:00:34.775 --> 00:00:35.855
Mom, it's over here.

00:00:41.095 --> 00:00:42.255
Forky!

00:00:42.415 --> 00:00:43.815
Mom, I found him!

00:00:43.895 --> 00:00:45.415
BONNIE'S MOM:
Oh, there he is!

00:00:45.935 --> 00:00:47.375
Now, please leave him
in there,

00:00:47.455 --> 00:00:48.535
so he doesn't get lost again.

00:00:56.135 --> 00:00:57.335
FORKY:
But what about Gabby?

00:00:59.055 --> 00:01:00.655
Forky, listen to me
very carefully.

00:01:00.815 --> 00:01:02.455
This is important.

00:01:02.615 --> 00:01:04.575
Tell Buzz to get the RV
to the merry-go-round.

00:01:04.735 --> 00:01:05.735
You understand?

00:01:05.895 --> 00:01:07.935
Absolutely.
What is a merry-go-round?

00:01:08.015 --> 00:01:10.655
(STAMMERS) The spinny ride
with lights and horses.

00:01:10.815 --> 00:01:12.055
-Oh. You mean a carousel.
-Yes!

00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:14.415
Carousel. Yes!
Meet me at the carousel.

00:01:14.535 --> 00:01:15.535
FORKY: Got it.

00:01:18.735 --> 00:01:20.255
(DOORBELL JINGLES)

00:01:26.975 --> 00:01:28.055
(GRUNTS)

00:01:28.975 --> 00:01:31.335
Gabby! Hey, Gabby!

00:01:32.055 --> 00:01:34.295
GABBY GABBY: You can have
your voice box back.

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:37.855
I don't need it anymore.

00:01:38.015 --> 00:01:39.135
Oh, yes, you do.

00:01:39.295 --> 00:01:40.975
Harmony wasn't
your only chance, Gabby,

00:01:41.055 --> 00:01:42.255
but we have to hurry. Come on.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:45.615
No. Harmony was my chance.

00:01:46.495 --> 00:01:48.655
My time's over.

00:01:48.735 --> 00:01:50.695
Now, please go away.

00:01:52.495 --> 00:01:53.495
(SIGHS)

00:01:56.935 --> 00:01:59.175
(CHILDREN CHATTERING
IN DISTANCE)

00:02:02.535 --> 00:02:03.895
You hear that?

00:02:10.495 --> 00:02:12.375
A friend once told me...

00:02:12.535 --> 00:02:14.975
"There are plenty of kids
out there."

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:18.615
And one of them
is named Bonnie.

00:02:20.455 --> 00:02:22.895
She's waiting for you,
right now.

00:02:24.295 --> 00:02:26.135
She just doesn't know it yet.

00:02:28.695 --> 00:02:31.015
What if you're wrong?

00:02:32.935 --> 00:02:34.735
Well, if you sit on a shelf
the rest of your life...

00:02:34.815 --> 00:02:36.775
you'll never find out,
will you?

00:02:37.415 --> 00:02:38.495
(THUD)

00:02:40.495 --> 00:02:41.735
He's right.

00:02:42.615 --> 00:02:44.455
I learned that from the best.

00:02:48.695 --> 00:02:50.855
Come on, Gabby.

00:02:51.055 --> 00:02:52.655
Let's get you to Bonnie.

00:02:59.415 --> 00:03:00.415
The carousel?

00:03:00.495 --> 00:03:03.095
Yeah, it's the spinny ride
with lights and horses.

00:03:03.255 --> 00:03:04.895
Woody said to meet him there.

00:03:05.055 --> 00:03:06.895
-You gotta be kidding!
-How do we do that?

00:03:06.975 --> 00:03:08.175
Oh! We could, uh...

00:03:08.255 --> 00:03:09.575
We are not
sending Dad to jail.

00:03:09.735 --> 00:03:10.775
You're no fun.

00:03:10.935 --> 00:03:13.535
FEMALE GPS VOICE:
Left turn in 0.5 miles.

00:03:13.695 --> 00:03:16.495
Wait a second. I have an idea.

00:03:17.255 --> 00:03:18.655
(DOORBELL JINGLES)

00:03:27.615 --> 00:03:28.615
-MAN: Skunk!
-(ALL GASP)

00:03:28.695 --> 00:03:29.695
WOMAN: Skunk!

00:03:31.615 --> 00:03:33.055
(GASPS)

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:36.855
(SCREAMS)

00:03:37.655 --> 00:03:39.095
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:03:40.535 --> 00:03:42.695
Too many people.
Gonna need an alternate route.

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:44.855
Will we make it
to the carousel in time?

00:03:48.815 --> 00:03:50.895
BOTH: Yes, we Canada!

00:03:51.055 --> 00:03:52.495
What? What is it?

00:03:53.175 --> 00:03:55.415
(SNORING)

00:03:58.535 --> 00:04:01.655
TRIXIE: Recalculating.
Take a right.

00:04:01.775 --> 00:04:02.935
What? A right?

00:04:03.095 --> 00:04:04.815
TRIXIE: Right turn ahead.

00:04:04.895 --> 00:04:06.735
BONNIE'S DAD: Huh. Does
the GPS sound funny to you?

00:04:06.815 --> 00:04:08.455
BONNIE'S MOM:
Honey, it's fine. Just drive.

00:04:08.535 --> 00:04:10.335
BONNIE'S DAD: Hmm,
I thought it sounded funny.

00:04:13.415 --> 00:04:14.415
Another right!

00:04:14.575 --> 00:04:16.615
-Right.
-Take another right.

00:04:16.695 --> 00:04:18.215
-Huh?
-Another right? Really?

00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:19.415
-Turn right!
-Now!

00:04:19.495 --> 00:04:20.895
-Turn right!
-(ALL GASP)

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:24.775
HAMM: We're headin' back.
SLINKY: There's the carousel!

00:04:24.855 --> 00:04:27.495
(GASPS) Do you think
Woody will get there in time?

00:04:27.695 --> 00:04:30.215
Nope. Forget it. Never.
No. No way. Declined.

00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:32.255
-No dice. Rejected.
-Duke, Duke, you got this.

00:04:32.455 --> 00:04:34.095
This is the fastest way
to the carousel.

00:04:34.255 --> 00:04:35.415
You made the last jump.

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:37.575
Yeah, but that was 4 feet.
This is 40!

00:04:37.735 --> 00:04:40.975
Exactly! Duke Caboom
would never repeat a stunt.

00:04:41.175 --> 00:04:42.935
-No. He'd never do that.
-No, no, no.

00:04:43.095 --> 00:04:45.095
He's the toy
that went on to crash

00:04:45.175 --> 00:04:48.175
40 feet into that target!

00:04:48.335 --> 00:04:50.295
Yeah, he is.

00:04:50.455 --> 00:04:51.975
I'm Duke Caboom!

00:04:52.135 --> 00:04:53.815
Oh, man. I can do this!

00:04:54.015 --> 00:04:55.215
Yes, you Canada!

00:04:55.375 --> 00:04:56.535
I can do it
with my eyes closed.

00:04:56.615 --> 00:04:57.615
Yes, you... What?

00:04:57.695 --> 00:04:59.295
-Three, two, one. Go!
-WOODY: What? No, wait!

00:05:05.295 --> 00:05:06.975
-What is he doing?
-Oh, no.

00:05:07.055 --> 00:05:08.655
(BREATHING RAPIDLY)

00:05:08.895 --> 00:05:09.935
(GRUNTS)

00:05:17.735 --> 00:05:19.935
This is for you, Rejean.

00:05:24.415 --> 00:05:25.415
(GROANS)

00:05:25.495 --> 00:05:26.735
Caboom.

00:05:29.975 --> 00:05:31.015
GIGGLE: Yes!

00:05:31.095 --> 00:05:32.455
-(ALL CHEERING)
-DUCKY: He did it!

00:05:32.615 --> 00:05:33.615
All right, our turn!

00:05:33.775 --> 00:05:35.695
You heard the sheriff.
Let's go.

00:05:35.775 --> 00:05:37.095
(BOTH YELL)

00:05:41.855 --> 00:05:42.855
WOODY: Yee-haw!

00:05:42.935 --> 00:05:44.135
(SHEEP BLEATING)

00:05:45.575 --> 00:05:46.975
TRIXIE: Another right!

00:05:47.135 --> 00:05:48.775
Another right?
That's the wrong way.

00:05:48.935 --> 00:05:50.815
-Are you sure?
-(SIGHS) Stupid rental.

00:05:50.975 --> 00:05:52.455
-I'm turning us around.
-TRIXIE: No!

00:05:52.535 --> 00:05:53.895
BONNIE'S DAD: Huh?
TRIXIE: Recalculating.

00:05:53.975 --> 00:05:55.055
Turn right.

00:05:55.215 --> 00:05:57.575
-Must be broken.
-No! No! (SCREAMS)

00:06:01.935 --> 00:06:03.055
(SCREAMS) What is happening?

00:06:03.135 --> 00:06:04.295
Honey, what are you doing?
Slow down!

00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:05.375
I can't! I can't!

00:06:05.975 --> 00:06:07.815
-Press the brake. Press it!
-BONNIE'S DAD: I'm trying.

00:06:08.295 --> 00:06:10.415
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:06:14.615 --> 00:06:16.055
GIGGLE: Got a visual
on the RV,

00:06:16.135 --> 00:06:18.175
-heading southbound.
-(SHEEP BLEATING)

00:06:23.495 --> 00:06:24.495
Gabby?

00:06:27.055 --> 00:06:28.055
Gabby?

00:06:28.855 --> 00:06:30.255
(LOST GIRL SOBBING)

00:06:32.015 --> 00:06:33.415
I think she's lost.

